    End Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was sent there from the Spell
    & Trap Zone this turn while face-up: You can add 1 "Polymerization" Spell, "Fusion"
    Spell, or "Fusion Parasite" from your Deck to your hand. You can only use each
    effect of "Kahyoreigetsu" once per turn.'
